# Get a key from https://console.anthropic.com/ (Settings -> API Keys).
# This is separate, pay-per-token billing from any Claude.ai subscription.
#
# Local dev: copy this file to .env and fill in the value (Vercel CLI reads
# .env automatically with `vercel dev`).
# Production: set this in the Vercel project's Settings -> Environment
# Variables instead of committing a real key anywhere.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
